        "html": "Hello AI enthusiasts,\n<br>\n<br>\n{{ $('Basic LLM Chain').item.json[\"email_intro\"] }}\n<br>\n{{ $json.result }}\n<br>\n{{ $('Basic LLM Chain').item.json[\"email_outro\"] }}\n<br>\nRegards,\n<br>\nAI x AI"
